# AArch64 translation table infrastructure for 4KB granule 4-level paging.
# Provides API-compatible types and constants matching the x86-64 paging module.
# AArch64 uses TTBR0/TTBR1 (equivalent to CR3) with 4 levels: L0, L1, L2, L3
# (equivalent to PML4, PDPT, PD, PT). Each level has 512 entries (9 bits each).
#
